  "body_md": "Waterfront and outdoor live music listings include Cortez, Anna Maria, Holmes Beach, Bradenton Beach, Bradenton, and Lakewood Ranch. Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar lists 5:00–8:00 pm seven nights a week, plus Saturday and Sunday lunch at 12:00–4:00 pm; Harry's Grill lists 6:00–8:30 pm Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday through Sunday; The Ugly Grouper lists live music daily; Freckled Fin Irish Pub lists most nights; Drift-In AMI lists almost every night; and Anna Maria Island Beach Cafe lists weekly live music.\n\n## By night\n\n- **Monday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Harry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper, Cortez Kitchen (blues, 5:00–8:00 pm), Freckled Fin Irish Pub (karaoke, 7:30–11:30 pm).\n- **Tuesday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Harry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper.\n- **Wednesday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, The Ugly Grouper.\n- **Thursday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Harry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper.\n- **Friday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Harry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper, 3 Keys Brewing, Ed's Tavern (8:00 pm), Cortez Kitchen.\n- **Saturday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Harry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper, 3 Keys Brewing, Ed's Tavern (8:00 pm), Cortez Kitchen.\n- **Sunday:** Swordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Harry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper, Cortez Kitchen.\n\n## Good to know\n\n- **Cover:** Ed's Tavern lists a free cover; other listings do not list a cover amount.\n- **Setting:** Waterfront, outdoor, and mixed settings are listed, and outdoor seating is tagged on most listings.\n- **Food:** A full menu is listed at seven venues.\n\n## FAQ\n\n### Which listings are waterfront or outdoor?\nSwordfish Grill & Tiki Bar, Cortez Kitchen, and Anna Maria Island Beach Cafe list waterfront settings; The Ugly Grouper and 3 Keys Brewing list outdoor settings.\n\n### Which listings are all ages?\nHarry's Grill, The Ugly Grouper, Freckled Fin Irish Pub, 3 Keys Brewing, Ed's Tavern, and Anna Maria Island Beach Cafe list all ages.\n\n### What styles are listed?\nListed styles include blues, classic covers, beach covers, originals, rock, reggae, classic rock, and acoustic.",
